{"id":"en_six-beast-husbands-kneel-to-their-queen","title":"Six Beast Husbands Kneel to Their Queen","titleEn":"Six Beast Husbands Kneel to Their Queen","description":"Irene Collins, who survived a post-apocalyptic Earth, wakes up in an interstellar world of beast people as a widely despised villainess. Her six beast husbands loathe her and intend to kill her once their three-month trial marriage ends. A mysterious system, storage space and plant-based powers let Irene advance quickly by hunting beasts and relying on her intelligence. She gradually wins over her vengeful mates and faces Jane, the fated heroine, along with Jane's noble fiancé Silas. The question is whether Irene can change her deadly fate and rise as the true queen of this world.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/six-beast-husbands-kneel-to-their-queen/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/six-beast-husbands-kneel-to-their-queen/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Sci-Fi","Romance","Underdog Rise","Female","Transmigration","Future"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7daehm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_six-beast-husbands-kneel-to-their-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7daehm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_six-beast-husbands-kneel-to-their-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7daehm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_six-beast-husbands-kneel-to-their-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7daehm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":